In SAP Cloud Platform Integration (CPI), the HTTPS adapter is a type of adapter that facilitates
secure communication between SAP CPI and external systems over the HTTPS protocol.
It acts as both a sender and receiver, enabling data exchange using HTTP/HTTPS for
various applications and platforms.

